WEBVTT

00:00:43.208 --> 00:00:46.417
Princess Kirin! I've come to rescue you!

00:00:46.417 --> 00:00:49.583
Prince Raika!

00:00:49.583 --> 00:00:53.458
Go! Prince Raika!

00:01:00.167 --> 00:01:03.125
That was a wonderful dream.

00:01:03.125 --> 00:01:09.042
Raika really is... my one and only prince!

00:02:40.375 --> 00:02:42.667
No way! I think I grew quite a bit taller!

00:02:42.667 --> 00:02:44.250
Really?

00:02:45.333 --> 00:02:46.500
"1-B" "Nagai"

00:02:47.125 --> 00:02:50.750
Today, we're having a physical exam
overseen by an upperclassman.

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:54.708
And the one who's assigned
to me is Aria. I'm so happy!

00:02:55.750 --> 00:03:00.333
Why does she have to be
with Aria even during school?!

00:03:00.333 --> 00:03:02.917
Raika...

00:03:02.917 --> 00:03:04.417
Oops.

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:06.958
Hm?

00:03:06.958 --> 00:03:08.333
Is something wrong, Raika?

00:03:08.333 --> 00:03:13.250
Well, I've been having this
feeling that I'm being watched lately.

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:14.708
Line up!

00:03:14.708 --> 00:03:16.917
First, I'll check your height.

00:03:16.917 --> 00:03:18.875
Depending on your physical build and strength,

00:03:18.875 --> 00:03:20.833
the proper firearm will
be different for each of you.

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:21.542
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:21.542 --> 00:03:22.208
"1-A, Shino Sasaki"
"Height (cm): 155"

00:03:22.208 --> 00:03:25.667
Shino Sasaki, 155cm.

00:03:25.667 --> 00:03:28.500
It looks like an M4 is good
for you, though just barely.

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:29.417
"1-A, Raika Hino"
"Height (cm): 165"

00:03:29.417 --> 00:03:32.958
Raika Hino, 165cm.

00:03:32.958 --> 00:03:36.417
You're probably tall enough to
carry even an FAL without dragging it.

00:03:36.417 --> 00:03:36.750
"1-A, Akari Mamiya"

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:40.125
Akari Mamiya, 139cm.

00:03:43.417 --> 00:03:45.958
I don't wanna use a weird gun like this!

00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:47.708
You look good with it.

00:03:47.708 --> 00:03:49.875
Shino! Measure me one more time!

00:03:49.875 --> 00:03:53.375
It'll be the same no matter how
many times you get measured.

00:03:53.375 --> 00:03:55.875
Right... Bottom...

00:03:55.875 --> 00:03:59.917
Left... Top...

00:04:02.542 --> 00:04:05.250
B-Bottom...

00:04:06.167 --> 00:04:09.958
--Her mouth is open! How cute! How cute! How cute!
--Top... Left... Uhm...

00:04:09.958 --> 00:04:13.250
Right. Top. Bottom. Left.

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:16.542
Left. Bottom. Top. Right.

00:04:16.542 --> 00:04:21.208
"Vision Test"
Top-right. Bottom-right. Top-left.

00:04:21.208 --> 00:04:22.917
"Vision Test"
Okay, that's it.

00:04:22.917 --> 00:04:26.083
"Vision Test"
Raika Hino... She's got very good vision.

00:04:26.083 --> 00:04:28.583
It's surprising that you can actually see that!

00:04:28.583 --> 00:04:30.417
That's amazing, Raika!

00:04:31.375 --> 00:04:34.042
Akari, Shino. Are you guys already giving up?

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:39.167
A-Aria...

00:04:42.042 --> 00:04:43.208
Five more minutes.

00:04:43.208 --> 00:04:44.083
Roger!

00:04:44.083 --> 00:04:46.375
She's so cool!

00:04:46.375 --> 00:04:48.875
In the last test,
we'll check your athletic ability.

00:04:48.875 --> 00:04:52.500
It also serves as a stress
reliever for the upperclassman

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.625
who was forced to attend to the Year 1 students.

00:04:54.625 --> 00:04:55.292
Huh?

00:04:55.292 --> 00:04:58.958
All three of you come at me at the same time!

00:04:58.958 --> 00:05:00.958
Ah...! That's right!

00:05:00.958 --> 00:05:04.250
If I find an opening, I might
be able to get my gun back.

00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:06.125
Okay!

00:05:06.125 --> 00:05:09.792
This is a chance for me to
crush Aria in all the confusion!

00:05:09.792 --> 00:05:14.042
I'm curious to see how
strong an S-rank <i>butei </i>is!

00:05:14.042 --> 00:05:15.458
Let's do it!

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:30.542
Akari! Shino! Above and below!

00:05:33.125 --> 00:05:34.542
Not bad.

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:49.542
What I just did is called Baritsu, a hand-to-hand
combat, passed down in my family.

00:05:49.542 --> 00:05:51.917
Two-gun combat...

00:05:51.917 --> 00:05:54.667
...isn't the only thing that I'm good at.

00:05:54.667 --> 00:05:56.333
Baritsu...

00:05:56.333 --> 00:06:01.167
Whoa... I wonder if Raika is okay...

00:06:01.167 --> 00:06:03.875
I can't really measure your abilities like this.

00:06:03.875 --> 00:06:06.708
You two, try fighting each other.

00:06:06.708 --> 00:06:08.792
This time, don't use any weapons.
Fight bare-handed.

00:06:08.792 --> 00:06:10.375
Huh? Fight Shino?

00:06:10.375 --> 00:06:12.208
Yes, ma'am! I'll be happy to!

00:06:12.208 --> 00:06:16.667
Actually, Aria might be a really nice person!

00:06:16.667 --> 00:06:18.375
Your opponent will be...

00:06:18.375 --> 00:06:21.792
Let's see... You! Will you help us?

00:06:21.792 --> 00:06:25.875
Hm? Huh? Me? Fight a girl?

00:06:25.875 --> 00:06:28.667
Right. A coed fight with her.

00:06:29.708 --> 00:06:32.000
Start when you're ready.

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:33.208
Akari!

00:06:33.208 --> 00:06:35.042
Ahh! What're you doing?!

00:06:35.042 --> 00:06:37.250
Whoa! A fight between a guy and a girl?

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:39.875
He's fighting Raika Hino!

00:06:39.875 --> 00:06:41.500
Go! Hino!

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.333
Beat that guy up!

00:06:43.333 --> 00:06:44.708
Begin!

00:06:51.625 --> 00:06:54.292
You bitch!

00:07:01.333 --> 00:07:03.208
Ow, ow, ow...

00:07:03.208 --> 00:07:04.000
That's it!

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:06.792
--Whoa!
--Whoa... Is she really a woman?

00:07:06.792 --> 00:07:08.917
Hino's amazing!

00:07:08.917 --> 00:07:11.667
Okay, good work. Thanks for your help.

00:07:11.667 --> 00:07:13.583
Damn you, mannish woman!

00:07:13.583 --> 00:07:16.833
Yeah, yeah. Come back and fight me any time.

00:07:16.833 --> 00:07:18.917
She really <i>is </i>cool!

00:07:18.917 --> 00:07:23.083
I can't stop... my fluttering heart!

00:07:23.083 --> 00:07:24.667
Hm?

00:07:37.542 --> 00:07:40.958
Shino! You're tickling me!

00:07:40.958 --> 00:07:43.417
You two! Fight seriously!

00:07:47.042 --> 00:07:51.542
Hmm... She'll probably
write a bad report about me.

00:07:51.542 --> 00:07:54.000
But you really were amazing, Raika.

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:58.375
Yes. To think that you
defeated such a big guy...

00:07:58.375 --> 00:08:00.625
That was nothing.

00:08:00.625 --> 00:08:05.833
I thought you'd win, though. I know you
fight well against bigger people, so...

00:08:05.833 --> 00:08:09.917
Well, we've known each
other since junior high, so...

00:08:09.917 --> 00:08:13.667
Yep! I know you inside out!

00:08:15.292 --> 00:08:19.000
In any case, we were no match for Aria, were we?

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:20.583
Nope!

00:08:26.125 --> 00:08:28.167
Ah, sorry.

00:08:28.167 --> 00:08:31.042
No problem. Sorry to bump into you.

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:38.125
Wow... What a pretty girl...

00:08:38.125 --> 00:08:40.875
She's Riko Mine from Year 2.

00:08:40.875 --> 00:08:45.333
I wish I could be a girly girl like her.

00:08:45.333 --> 00:08:48.000
Damn you, mannish woman!

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.292
What's wrong, Raika?

00:08:50.292 --> 00:08:52.042
Oh, nothing.

00:08:52.042 --> 00:08:53.667
Let's go home.

00:08:56.333 --> 00:09:00.167
Akari, you don't have to go see Aria today?

00:09:00.167 --> 00:09:02.625
Nope. She said she had
some business to take care of.

00:09:02.625 --> 00:09:05.042
Then, why don't we go and
have some Leaf Pies today?

00:09:05.042 --> 00:09:06.792
Hm...? Ah!

00:09:06.792 --> 00:09:08.542
Hm?

00:09:20.542 --> 00:09:22.750
"What?! What?! What?! What?! What?!"

00:09:23.125 --> 00:09:29.542
Oh, my... So the "business"
she had to take care of was a date, huh?

00:09:29.542 --> 00:09:33.042
That guy is Kinji Tohyama from Year 2.

00:09:33.042 --> 00:09:35.042
He was an S-rank <i>butei </i>last year.

00:09:35.042 --> 00:09:38.167
A legendary guy who defeated
a teacher in the entrance exam.

00:09:38.167 --> 00:09:40.333
S rank when he was still in Year 1...

00:09:40.333 --> 00:09:45.208
He may be a good match for Aria.

00:09:46.583 --> 00:09:49.625
Well then, shall we go now?

00:09:49.625 --> 00:09:51.917
Huh?

00:09:51.917 --> 00:09:54.750
Akari! What about the Leaf Pies?!

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:58.625
Sorry! We'll go next time!

00:09:58.625 --> 00:10:00.792
After all, I shouldn't forgive Aria!

00:10:00.792 --> 00:10:01.958
Hm?

00:10:03.625 --> 00:10:07.875
Kinji Tohyama... I'm gonna
investigate what kind of person he is!

00:10:28.125 --> 00:10:29.583
Ah...!

00:10:33.042 --> 00:10:35.000
Who are you?

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.708
Upperclassman...!

00:10:38.083 --> 00:10:39.542
...Kinji Tohyama...

00:10:39.542 --> 00:10:42.583
Oh, it's you. You were the one hanging
on to the monorail the other day.

00:10:42.583 --> 00:10:45.500
Why are you following me?

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:47.667
Because...

00:10:47.667 --> 00:10:49.250
Because it's not fair!

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:50.417
Huh?

00:10:50.417 --> 00:10:55.208
I had to try very hard
to finally become close to Aria!

00:10:55.208 --> 00:10:57.458
I don't get your point.

00:10:57.458 --> 00:10:59.917
Are you a fan of Aria's?

00:10:59.917 --> 00:11:02.625
It's not like that! I'm...

00:11:02.625 --> 00:11:05.083
I don't know how it appears,

00:11:05.083 --> 00:11:09.667
but it's actually a bother
that Aria is following me around.

00:11:09.667 --> 00:11:12.000
B-Bother?

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:16.417
H-How rude!

00:11:16.417 --> 00:11:20.917
Your tailing skills are terrible.
Which junior high are you from?

00:11:20.917 --> 00:11:23.417
A-A plain old junior high school.

00:11:23.417 --> 00:11:26.667
I transferred in during
the second term of Year 3.

00:11:26.667 --> 00:11:29.000
A plain old junior high, huh?

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.583
What's...

00:11:30.583 --> 00:11:35.375
What's wrong with a plain old junior high?!

00:11:35.375 --> 00:11:38.458
Plain...!

00:11:50.042 --> 00:11:50.917
Master!

00:11:50.917 --> 00:11:53.333
Fuma! H-Help me!

00:11:53.333 --> 00:11:56.167
Get a hold of yourself! I'm coming!

00:11:56.167 --> 00:11:58.458
What's with these people?

00:11:59.542 --> 00:12:00.542
Investigation?

00:12:00.542 --> 00:12:03.208
That's right. I'm trying to
see if I can use Kinji Tohyama

00:12:03.208 --> 00:12:06.458
for the current investigation
I'm conducting, that's all.

00:12:06.458 --> 00:12:08.583
Oh, I didn't know.

00:12:08.583 --> 00:12:10.375
So what kind of investigation is it?

00:12:10.375 --> 00:12:13.042
I'm sorry, but I can't tell you more than that.

00:12:13.042 --> 00:12:13.875
Ah...

00:12:13.875 --> 00:12:19.042
Remember? I told you that I wouldn't
let you take part in my operations.

00:12:19.042 --> 00:12:21.875
You're still in training.

00:12:21.875 --> 00:12:23.042
Yes, ma'am...

00:12:23.042 --> 00:12:25.833
Do you remember what I told you?

00:12:25.833 --> 00:12:28.750
First, crimes and incidents
don't wait for <i>butei </i>to be ready.

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:31.125
Second, you should always be punctual.

00:12:31.125 --> 00:12:32.125
And...

00:12:32.125 --> 00:12:34.167
And?

00:12:34.167 --> 00:12:37.917
Third, you should pay more
attention to your surroundings.

00:12:39.208 --> 00:12:42.208
That girl, Shino Sasaki, was acting strange,

00:12:42.208 --> 00:12:44.333
but you didn't notice it, did you?

00:12:45.583 --> 00:12:50.083
Don't repeat... the same mistake.

00:12:50.083 --> 00:12:51.667
Well then, later.

00:12:55.667 --> 00:13:00.250
I guess I'm still not good
enough to be of help to Aria yet.

00:13:01.917 --> 00:13:05.417
I wonder when I can become her official Amica...

00:13:05.417 --> 00:13:09.292
Kirin Shima, was it?

00:13:09.292 --> 00:13:11.333
You're a junior high student, aren't you?

00:13:11.333 --> 00:13:14.000
What'd you call me out here for?

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:16.125
Raika...

00:13:16.125 --> 00:13:20.625
Please... make me your Amica!

00:13:20.625 --> 00:13:22.333
Huh?

00:13:23.958 --> 00:13:26.125
Please make me your Amica!

00:13:26.125 --> 00:13:27.333
I refuse.

00:13:27.333 --> 00:13:32.583
I'm still in Year 1. I have no
intention of having an Amica yet.

00:13:32.583 --> 00:13:34.542
That doesn't matter!

00:13:34.542 --> 00:13:38.917
Riko Mine made me her Amica last year.

00:13:38.917 --> 00:13:40.875
Riko...?

00:13:42.458 --> 00:13:45.167
Don't compare me with her.

00:13:45.167 --> 00:13:46.625
In any case, I refuse.

00:13:46.625 --> 00:13:48.375
Raika...

00:13:57.667 --> 00:13:59.167
See ya!

00:13:59.833 --> 00:14:04.250
Sheesh... She's stubborn.

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:08.208
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to eavesdrop.

00:14:08.208 --> 00:14:11.375
That's okay. I don't care about it anyway.

00:14:11.375 --> 00:14:14.583
Kirin Shima, was it? She's cute.

00:14:14.583 --> 00:14:16.333
Why don't you help her?

00:14:16.333 --> 00:14:17.833
That's nonsense.

00:14:17.833 --> 00:14:19.542
You don't like that type of girl?

00:14:19.542 --> 00:14:22.333
I wouldn't go that far, but...

00:14:22.333 --> 00:14:26.083
Raika Hino? That mannish
woman is at the very bottom!

00:14:26.083 --> 00:14:29.333
Oh, yeah, of course. She's pretty much a man.

00:14:29.333 --> 00:14:32.083
Her height is almost 170cm, too.

00:14:32.083 --> 00:14:36.375
Then, the last place of
Year-1 girls is Raika Hino.

00:14:42.917 --> 00:14:45.083
Stupid guys!

00:14:45.083 --> 00:14:46.583
Raika!

00:14:46.583 --> 00:14:50.125
Huh? Are you going to the restroom, too?

00:14:50.125 --> 00:14:53.875
You think I mind what we just heard?

00:14:53.875 --> 00:14:57.042
You dummy. Go ahead
and go back to the classroom.

00:14:57.042 --> 00:14:59.375
O-Okay...

00:15:11.583 --> 00:15:14.083
You should pay more
attention to your surroundings.

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:20.458
I didn't really know Raika...

00:15:22.583 --> 00:15:24.083
I have to take care of something, so...

00:15:24.083 --> 00:15:26.250
O-Okay.

00:15:27.708 --> 00:15:30.250
I wonder what she needs to do.

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:30.875
Whoa!

00:15:30.875 --> 00:15:32.417
Miss Mamiya!

00:15:32.417 --> 00:15:35.208
I have an important matter
that I'd like to discuss with you.

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.958
She's pretty much a man.

00:15:39.958 --> 00:15:42.292
The last place is Raika Hino.

00:15:42.292 --> 00:15:44.750
Argh! I can't shake it!

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:49.917
I think I'll go to that place again.
I need to relieve my stress.

00:15:49.917 --> 00:15:52.125
Kirin, what am I doing here?

00:15:52.125 --> 00:15:54.792
I'd like you to help me!

00:15:54.792 --> 00:15:59.250
<i>You </i>should understand how I feel!

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:02.708
But I'm not good at tailing people.

00:16:02.708 --> 00:16:06.958
Raika is an inattentive person, so don't worry.

00:16:06.958 --> 00:16:11.208
I've been staring at her all this time,
and she hasn't noticed me.

00:16:11.208 --> 00:16:14.917
So it was Kirin who's been watching Raika.

00:16:21.667 --> 00:16:23.667
I wonder where Raika's going.

00:16:23.667 --> 00:16:25.167
Don't tell me...!

00:16:25.167 --> 00:16:26.708
Oh, that's cute!

00:16:26.708 --> 00:16:28.792
So cute!

00:16:28.792 --> 00:16:29.458
You look good in it.

00:16:29.458 --> 00:16:31.333
Thank you for coming again!

00:16:31.333 --> 00:16:34.708
We just got new costumes.

00:16:34.708 --> 00:16:36.417
Uhm, can I try them on?

00:16:36.417 --> 00:16:41.333
Of course! We want you to enjoy them.
That's what our store is for!

00:16:41.333 --> 00:16:45.667
People long for what they don't have.

00:16:45.667 --> 00:16:48.333
A cosplay store, huh?

00:16:48.333 --> 00:16:51.125
I'd never have believed
that she relieves stress this way,

00:16:51.125 --> 00:16:52.667
but I don't think it's a problem.

00:16:52.667 --> 00:16:55.208
It <i>is </i>a problem. That's a regression.

00:16:55.208 --> 00:16:57.208
And it's a serious one.

00:16:57.208 --> 00:16:58.583
Regression...

00:16:58.583 --> 00:17:03.208
At Butei High, even when you're a girl,
you're expected to perform like a guy.

00:17:03.208 --> 00:17:06.208
Depending on the person,
they might go into a girlish hobby like that

00:17:06.208 --> 00:17:08.667
in order to balance their mind!

00:17:08.667 --> 00:17:12.917
If the condition gets bad enough,
they might even need to see a counselor.

00:17:12.917 --> 00:17:14.958
Whoa...

00:17:17.375 --> 00:17:20.542
Raika...

00:17:20.542 --> 00:17:23.375
You look so beautiful!

00:17:23.375 --> 00:17:24.958
I do?

00:17:24.958 --> 00:17:28.167
I really don't look good in these.

00:17:28.167 --> 00:17:32.000
In my dream, the prince saved the princess.

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:36.125
It's time for the princess to save the prince!

00:17:38.875 --> 00:17:41.000
Wh-What're you guys doing here?!

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:43.125
Ah... well... uhm...

00:17:43.125 --> 00:17:48.042
You're a <i>butei</i>. If you didn't notice
that we were watching, it's your own fault.

00:17:48.042 --> 00:17:50.375
If you spread this around, I'll kill you!

00:17:50.375 --> 00:17:51.375
Kill her?!

00:17:51.375 --> 00:17:54.875
Of course, I'll keep my mouth shut.

00:17:54.875 --> 00:17:58.417
But I won't do it for nothing.

00:18:08.167 --> 00:18:14.458
We'll begin an Amica Chance Match
between Kirin Shima and Raika Hino!

00:18:14.458 --> 00:18:17.833
You're free to use any
items except guns and knives.

00:18:17.833 --> 00:18:22.583
You lose when you give up
or your back touches the ground.

00:18:22.583 --> 00:18:25.583
Wait! Why am I acting as a referee?!

00:18:25.583 --> 00:18:32.042
If I win... I want you to make me your Amica.

00:18:32.042 --> 00:18:36.625
If I win... don't follow me around anymore.

00:18:55.125 --> 00:18:57.000
You like...

00:19:00.458 --> 00:19:02.208
...this kind of stuff, don't you?

00:19:03.958 --> 00:19:08.083
Y... You have too many openings!

00:19:08.083 --> 00:19:11.208
Go, Jonathan Number 3!

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:33.500
Uhm... Kirin Shima wins!

00:19:34.667 --> 00:19:36.292
What? What?!

00:19:36.292 --> 00:19:39.333
You're my big sister!

00:19:39.333 --> 00:19:44.333
You're my big sister! My sister! My sister!

00:19:44.333 --> 00:19:47.542
Raika, you were acting a little
strange when you were defeated.

00:19:47.542 --> 00:19:48.250
Strange?

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:50.417
You used a foot technique to end the match.

00:19:50.417 --> 00:19:55.000
Raika is good at dodging
that and using a joint lock.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.500
But she didn't do it with you.

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:01.333
Then she lost on purpose?

00:20:01.333 --> 00:20:02.667
Why?

00:20:02.667 --> 00:20:06.333
I-I thought it was okay that time.

00:20:06.333 --> 00:20:07.542
Huh?

00:20:07.542 --> 00:20:12.833
I thought it was okay
to make you my Amica, so...

00:20:12.833 --> 00:20:14.917
...don't feel down.

00:20:14.917 --> 00:20:18.250
It was you who made her think that way, Kirin.

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:19.542
Miss Mamiya...

00:20:19.542 --> 00:20:21.875
You dummy! She didn't need to know that!

00:20:21.875 --> 00:20:24.625
Ah! Kirin!

00:20:25.875 --> 00:20:27.542
And the girls from yesterday?

00:20:27.542 --> 00:20:29.042
Riko!

00:20:29.042 --> 00:20:30.542
What a coincidence!

00:20:30.542 --> 00:20:33.292
Wow! You all look super cute!

00:20:33.292 --> 00:20:36.708
I was able to become this upperclassman's Amica!

00:20:36.708 --> 00:20:40.542
Oh, I see! Please take
good care of my little sister.

00:20:40.542 --> 00:20:42.125
O-Okay.

00:20:42.125 --> 00:20:44.458
Well then, see you around...

00:20:44.458 --> 00:20:47.208
...Akari...

00:20:47.208 --> 00:20:48.917
...Mamiya.

00:20:51.167 --> 00:20:53.958
She really is pretty.

00:20:53.958 --> 00:20:56.917
Kirin, are you really sure
that you wanna be my Amica?

00:20:56.917 --> 00:21:00.250
You were an Amica with such a pretty person.

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:04.833
Riko was very nice and took good care of me.

00:21:04.833 --> 00:21:09.042
But it was just an
upperclassman-underclassman relationship.

00:21:09.042 --> 00:21:14.375
Raika, you look really good
in that costume, too.

00:21:14.375 --> 00:21:21.042
--Hey! Wait! Don't touch me!
--I wonder how she knew my name...

00:21:21.042 --> 00:21:22.583
You found nothing?

00:21:22.583 --> 00:21:27.625
Right. I checked Akari
Mamiya's records at school,

00:21:27.625 --> 00:21:30.375
but I didn't find anything special to report.

00:21:30.375 --> 00:21:32.625
What about her parents and relatives?

00:21:32.625 --> 00:21:34.167
Nothing specific, either.

00:21:34.167 --> 00:21:39.125
It looks like she lives with her little sister
separately from her parents, though.

00:21:41.708 --> 00:21:43.917
There are two possibilities.

00:21:43.917 --> 00:21:46.458
It's either that there
really is nothing to note, or...

00:21:46.458 --> 00:21:51.708
Or she's hiding her past quite well.

00:21:51.708 --> 00:21:54.792
Is it okay to continue the investigation?

00:21:54.792 --> 00:21:57.958
Yeah, thanks. Something about her...

00:21:57.958 --> 00:22:00.083
...really bothers me.

00:22:05.625 --> 00:22:07.083
I feel there's something...

00:22:07.083 --> 00:22:08.250
"Episode 3: Applying to be an Amica"

00:22:08.250 --> 00:22:10.375
"Episode 3: Applying to be an Amica"
...dangerous about her.

00:23:41.583 --> 00:23:42.875
Quartet?

00:23:42.875 --> 00:23:45.625
To think that I'm fighting a
pathetic E rank like you again...

00:23:45.625 --> 00:23:47.417
You have neither elegance nor techniques.

00:23:47.417 --> 00:23:50.375
That Akari Mamiya girl is by Aria's side!

00:23:50.375 --> 00:23:52.625
That's the phrase you forbade me to use, so...

00:23:52.625 --> 00:23:54.875
You can't defeat us.

00:23:55.250 --> 00:23:56.246
"Episode 4: Quartet, Part 1"
